---
// Standalone glassmorphism prototype (noindex, not in sitemap).
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>Fieldnote — Medium glass</title>
<style is:inline>
:root{--blur:20px;--glass:rgba(255,252,247,.35);--line:rgba(60,45,30,.12);--hi:rgba(255,255,255,.7);--fg:#231c15;--muted:#5b4f43;--accent:#2f3b2f;--r:14px;
--shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(70,50,30,.06),0 10px 30px rgba(70,50,30,.08),0 40px 80px rgba(70,50,30,.08)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;color:var(--fg);font:17px/1.65 ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,"Helvetica Neue",system-ui,sans-serif;min-height:100vh;
background:radial-gradient(55vw 60vh at 10% 10%,#f3d9b8 0,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(50vw 50vh at 90% 30%,#cfdcc8 0,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(60vw 50vh at 50% 100%,#e9c9b0 0,transparent 60%),#f4ece1;background-attachment:fixed}
.serif{font-family:ui-serif,"New York",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-weight:400}
.glass{background:var(--glass);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(var(--blur)) saturate(120%);backdrop-filter:blur(var(--blur)) saturate(120%);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 var(--hi),var(--shadow)}
@supports not ((backdrop-filter:blur(1px)) or (-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(1px))){.glass{background:#fbf6ef}}
@media (prefers-reduced-transparency:reduce){.glass{background:#fbf6ef;-webkit-backdrop-filter:none;backdrop-filter:none}}
.wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}a{color:inherit}
a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:6px}
header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:28px 0}header nav a{margin-left:24px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
.logo{font-size:24px}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#f7f2ea;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;transition:opacity .2s}.btn:hover{opacity:.88}
.link{color:var(--fg);font-size:15px;margin-left:18px;text-underline-offset:4px}
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;padding:72px 0 110px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6.4vw,84px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 24px}.hero h1 em{font-style:italic;color:#6b4a2b}
.hero p{color:var(--muted);font-size:19px;max-width:500px;margin:0 0 32px}
.note{padding:28px;transform:rotate(1.2deg)}.note small{color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:11px}
.note h3{font-size:26px;margin:8px 0 12px}.note li{padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);list-style:none;font-size:15px}.note ul{padding:0;margin:0}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;padding:56px 0}.row.flip>:first-child{order:2}
.row h2{font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:-.015em}.row p{color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.kicker{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b4a2b;margin-bottom:10px;display:block}
.panel{padding:36px;min-height:240px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end}.panel b{font-size:56px;font-family:ui-serif,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400}
.quote{margin:90px auto;max-width:820px;padding:56px;text-align:center}.quote blockquote{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px);line-height:1.3}.quote cite{color:var(--muted);font-style:normal;font-size:15px}
.cta{text-align:center;padding:40px 0 100px}.cta h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4.5vw,56px);margin:0 0 24px}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px 0 40px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
@media(max-width:820px){.hero,.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.row.flip>:first-child{order:0}header nav{display:none}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}.note{transform:none}}
</style></head><body><div class="wrap">
<header><span class="logo serif">Fieldnote</span><nav><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#stories">Stories</a><a href="#start">Pricing</a></nav></header>
<section class="hero"><div><h1 class="serif">Research that <em>reads</em> like a story.</h1><p>Fieldnote turns interviews, notes and recordings into a single, searchable narrative your whole team can actually follow.</p><a class="btn" href="#start">Try Fieldnote</a><a class="link" href="#how">Read the guide →</a></div>
<aside class="note glass"><small>This week's synthesis</small><h3 class="serif">Onboarding interviews</h3><ul><li>12 sessions · 4 themes</li><li>"Setup felt longer than it was"</li><li>Pricing page is the #2 exit</li><li>Shared by Ana, 2 hours ago</li></ul></aside></section>
<section id="how" class="row"><div><span class="kicker">Capture</span><h2 class="serif">Every conversation, in one place.</h2><p>Drop in audio, docs or chat exports. Fieldnote transcribes, tags speakers and keeps the original context one click away.</p></div><div class="panel glass"><b>38 min</b><span style="color:var(--muted)">average interview, indexed in seconds</span></div></section>
<section class="row flip"><div><span class="kicker">Synthesize</span><h2 class="serif">Themes emerge on their own.</h2><p>Highlights cluster into themes as you work. Rename, merge, or split them — the evidence follows.</p></div><div class="panel glass"><b>4 themes</b><span style="color:var(--muted)">from 212 highlights, all traceable</span></div></section>
<section class="row"><div><span class="kicker">Share</span><h2 class="serif">Findings people finish reading.</h2><p>Publish a living report with quotes and clips. Stakeholders comment in place; nothing gets lost in slides.</p></div><div class="panel glass"><b>94%</b><span style="color:var(--muted)">of reports read to the end</span></div></section>
<section id="stories" class="quote glass"><blockquote class="serif">"We stopped arguing about what customers said. Now we just open Fieldnote and look."</blockquote><cite>Mara Okafor — Head of Research, Northwind</cite></section>
<section id="start" class="cta"><h2 class="serif">Start with your next interview.</h2><a class="btn" href="#">Create a free workspace</a></section>
<footer><span>© 2026 Fieldnote</span><span>Privacy · Terms · Contact</span></footer>
</div></body></html>
